    {"type":"text","id":"state_note","x":505,"y":296,"width":210,"height":48,"text":"state Ch0 ready\n来自初始化 / Ch−1","originalText":"state Ch0 ready\n来自初始化 / Ch−1","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#047857","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"seed":11101,"version":1,"versionNonce":11201,"isDeleted":false,"lineHeight":1.2},
    {"type":"text","id":"note","x":230,"y":660,"width":1770,"height":112,"text":"绿色虚线向上：两路 BF16 状态副本/R 分片拼成 AIC 的 32 列输入；Ch0 的状态副本来自初始化或 Ch−1。橙色虚线向下：AIC 将 U/pred、delta、history/local 按 16+16 写给两路 AIV。\n两路 AIV 均已预取 d=state_decay[Dk]；UpdateStateAndShadowVF 以 state'=d⊙state+δ 更新 FP32 state，并同步生成 BF16 状态副本。MTE3 发布副本后，AIC 才能读取 Ch1 state。\nAIV 随后等待 history/local 生成 O。此处只解释一个 Chunk 的依赖；下图再展开实际槽位。","originalText":"绿色虚线向上：两路 BF16 状态副本/R 分片拼成 AIC 的 32 列输入；Ch0 的状态副本来自初始化或 Ch−1。橙色虚线向下：AIC 将 U/pred、delta、history/local 按 16+16 写给两路 AIV。\n两路 AIV 均已预取 d=state_decay[Dk]；UpdateStateAndShadowVF 以 state'=d⊙state+δ 更新 FP32 state，并同步生成 BF16 状态副本。MTE3 发布副本后，AIC 才能读取 Ch1 state。\nAIV 随后等待 history/local 生成 O。此处只解释一个 Chunk 的依赖；下图再展开实际槽位。","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"seed":11100,"version":3,"versionNonce":11200,"isDeleted":false,"lineHeight":1.3},
