    {"type":"text","id":"slot_note","x":225,"y":1385,"width":1770,"height":118,"text":"实际资源并不是“整体单槽”：Chunk 只读矩阵、Value、BF16 状态副本及 AIC↔AIV 结果按 s0/s1 交替；L0A 为 2 槽，L0C 按 q0..q3 滚动。\n两路 AIV 各自只有 1 份 FP32 递推 state；stateDecay 和短生命中间量按 s0/s1 交替，VF 执行 state'=stateDecay⊙state+delta 并生成 BF16 状态副本。R 的共享 L1 也只有 1 槽，因此 R0 被 AIC 取走并归还后才能写 R1。\n图只画就绪方向，反向的空槽归还信号省略；全部 Chunk 完成后的 final_state 写回见下图。","originalText":"实际资源并不是“整体单槽”：Chunk 只读矩阵、Value、BF16 状态副本及 AIC↔AIV 结果按 s0/s1 交替；L0A 为 2 槽，L0C 按 q0..q3 滚动。\n两路 AIV 各自只有 1 份 FP32 递推 state；stateDecay 和短生命中间量按 s0/s1 交替，VF 执行 state'=stateDecay⊙state+delta 并生成 BF16 状态副本。R 的共享 L1 也只有 1 槽，因此 R0 被 AIC 取走并归还后才能写 R1。\n图只画就绪方向，反向的空槽归还信号省略；全部 Chunk 完成后的 final_state 写回见下图。","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"seed":11261,"version":3,"versionNonce":11361,"isDeleted":false,"lineHeight":1.3},
    {"type":"line","id":"drain_divider","x":45,"y":1530,"width":1970,"height":0,"strokeColor":"#1e3a5f","backgroundColor":"transparent","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"seed":11262,"version":1,"versionNonce":11362,"isDeleted":false,"points":[[0,0],[1970,0]]},
    {"type":"text","id":"drain_title","x":48,"y":1560,"width":1850,"height":38,"text":"任务结束：最后一个 Chunk 的状态副本直接写回 final_state","originalText":"任务结束：最后一个 Chunk 的状态副本直接写回 final_state","fontSize":27,"fontFamily":5,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#1e40af","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"seed":11263,"version":1,"versionNonce":11363,"isDeleted":false,"lineHeight":1.2},
